@TalentX.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5035

### Health Check
GET {{TalentX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Health
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Employer (Valid)
POST {{TalentX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/employers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah Connor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@cyberdyne.com",
  "companyName": "Cyberdyne Systems",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!"
}

###

### Create Employer (Validation Failure - Password Mismatch)
POST {{TalentX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/employers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah Connor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@cyberdyne.com",
  "companyName": "Cyberdyne Systems",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "DifferentPassword123!"
}

###

### Create Employer (Validation Failure - Weak Password & Invalid Email)
POST {{TalentX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/employers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "companyName": "",
  "password": "weak",
  "confirmPassword": "weak"
}

###
